{"id":"pre_paration","lemma":"préparation","pos":"noun","rank":3850,"glosses":["preparation"],"ipa":"/pʁe.pa.ʁa.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/eb/Fr-pr%C3%A9paration.ogg/Fr-pr%C3%A9paration.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"préparations"},"formAudio":{"préparations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-pr%C3%A9parations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La clé, c'est la préparation.","en":"The key is preparation.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"key"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Elle nettoyait la maison en préparation de la fête.","en":"She was cleaning the house in preparation for a party.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to clean","l":"nettoyer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null,{"g":"party, celebration"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"Je suis occupé à la préparation du prochain examen.","en":"I'm busy preparing for the next exam.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"busy"},null,null,null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"upcoming"},{"g":"examination"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Le rapport est en cours de préparation par le comité.","en":"The report is being prepared by the committee.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"report"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"committee"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"in the process of"]]},{"text":"Nous avons échoué à cause d'un manque de préparation.","en":"We failed due to a lack of preparation.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to fail","l":"échouer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"cause"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"lack, absence"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}